==Description==
'''Flex''' is an [[Emotes|emote]] that can be bought in the store for {{Coins|500}}. It was made by [https://www.roblox.com/users/84886955/profile Shapic2]. The emote is not looped and no music can be heard while performing the emote. You cannot move while performing this emote.

