</gallery>
}}

==Trivia==
*The '''Flex''' [[Emotes|emote]] is based on the [https://wiki.teamfortress.com/wiki/Proletariat_Posedown Proletariat Posedown] from ''Team Fortress 2''.
*This was one of the first emotes to be added to the game.
*The '''Flex''' emote can be seen on the ''Solo Player'' [[Badges|badge]].

==Update History==
*'''19 July 2019''' - [[BETA v1.6|BETA v1.6.0]]
**'''Flex''' added.
*'''13 October 2019''' - [[Release v1.0|Release v1.0.0]]
**'''Flex''' is now looped.
*'''29 October 2020''' - [[Overhaul v1.0|Overhaul v1.0.0]]
**Animation replaced.
**'''Flex''' is no longer looped.



